# Code ownership for {{Demo Title}}.
# Each domain is owned by a team; a PR touching that path needs the team's approval.
# Replace {{@org/team}} handles with real teams. For a solo demo, point them all at your
# own handle to allow self-merge.
#
# Order matters: the LAST matching pattern wins.

# Default owner for everything.
*                       {{@your-handle}}

# Per-domain ownership — the governance "wow": a change to compliance/rules needs the
# compliance team, and can't merge without them.
/agents/                {{@org/platform-team}}
/agents/compliance/     {{@org/compliance-team}}
/agents/risk-assessment/ {{@org/risk-team}}

# Infra and evals often warrant tighter review.
/infra/                 {{@org/platform-team}}
/evals/                 {{@org/qa-team}}
